<section id="about" class="section white-section"><div class="container about-grid"><div class="portrait-block">{site.photo.src ? <img src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}${site.photo.src}`} alt={site.photo.alt} width="600" height="720" loading="lazy"/> : <div class="portrait-placeholder" role="img" aria-label="Professional photograph of Kirti Patange to be added"><span class="portrait-initials" aria-hidden="true">KP</span><span>Professional portrait forthcoming</span></div>}<div class="portrait-caption"><strong>{site.name}</strong><span>{site.location}</span></div></div><div><p class="eyebrow">Meet your HR advisor</p><h2>Business perspective.<br/>People understanding.</h2><p class="about-lead">Kirti Patange brings 17+ years of HR experience to the questions growing organisations face.</p><p>Her background combines senior internal HR leadership with independent consulting. She has worked across technology, manufacturing and oil & gas, with consulting projects in hospitality, fashion, professional services and EdTech.</p><p>From workforce planning and performance management to HRMS implementation and employee lifecycle processes, Kirti connects people, processes and technology to business priorities.</p><p>Her approach centres on practical structures that leaders and teams can use: clear roles, consistent people practices, useful information and shared accountability.</p><div class="about-details"><span>Senior HR leadership</span><span>Independent consulting</span><span>Pan-India HR experience</span></div><a class="text-link" href="#contact">Start a conversation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
